Author: Wasim Jalali <245747147+wasimjalali@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Sun Oct 18 23:15:28 2026 +0200

    fix: resume only confirmed pauses, log refusals, and play media again on any quit

    The pause script reports per session whether Windows paused or refused it. A resume
    plays only confirmed, untouched sessions, or a lost-answer session whose timeline
    shows our pause. Quit cuts the settle short, a disposed runner drops queued media
    requests, and before-quit and session-end run the same one-time resume.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

